# Git remote: SjPn/REM

- Remote: `https://github.com/SjPn/REM.git` (origin)
- After finishing meaningful code/UI/docs changes in this project, **commit and push** to `origin` on the current branch (usually `main`) without waiting for a separate ask.
- Do not force-push to `main`. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, DB dumps).
- Skip empty commits. If there is nothing to commit, do not push.
- Keep commit messages concise (1–2 sentences, why over what).
